{"steam_appid":2861210,"steam_name":"HYPNOS","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2861210/1162271956/6eb5a9b8cd98734be7b7121e1db64939baff2986/1779438750/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788178785","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257332350/8546c1b7d2688d561636deec2f5fc579d6529263/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788178785","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/7e6dbfa8ed2102d1ea82cc822990585d316ceae4/ss_7e6dbfa8ed2102d1ea82cc822990585d316ceae4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289474","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/d9218a4119c9809d6cb0e1f911c33f4e3b0a23fd/ss_d9218a4119c9809d6cb0e1f911c33f4e3b0a23fd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289474","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/134b8acb2c68d738dba9eae09c816618aa38a772/ss_134b8acb2c68d738dba9eae09c816618aa38a772.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289474","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/f8e9246f0b0c73d68f89c0a92e1f86ab00f44200/ss_f8e9246f0b0c73d68f89c0a92e1f86ab00f44200.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289474","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/39021dcdd582399d76123827600dfb5ce199af13/ss_39021dcdd582399d76123827600dfb5ce199af13.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289474"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPNOS</strong> is a first-person adventure and exploration game, set in a lovecraftian megastructure fever dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Nameless City at the edge of Dreams. Follow the trail into the shadow of the Holy Mountain. Wander through realms where the laws of the universe break down as they yield to other forces. Walk the Path and embrace your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><strong>YOUR STORY IS BEING WRITTEN </strong> <br> <br><strong>IN THE PAGES OF THE MAZE CHRONICLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/dc1366a5c8ec2b01b95580c52e034358.poster.avif?t=1793289474\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/dc1366a5c8ec2b01b95580c52e034358.webm?t=1793289474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/dc1366a5c8ec2b01b95580c52e034358.mp4?t=1793289474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“In the Dreamlands, all paths lead to the holy mountain of Kadath, where the gods dwell.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadowed by the mountain is the Nameless City, built on the ruins of those who came before. </i><br><br><br><i>There, Choron, a vagabond burdened by his past, searches for a faceless boy who haunts his dreams. </i><br><br><br><i>To find the boy and unravel the threads of his own destiny, Choron must solve the city's mysteries, face the Monarchs who rule the far reaches of the world and cross the veils that separate ignorance from truth.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIND THE FACELESS BOY </strong><br><br><strong>FIND MATTHEW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/f5f9a4440feadbd960169038f843d4ea.poster.avif?t=1793289474\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/f5f9a4440feadbd960169038f843d4ea.webm?t=1793289474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/f5f9a4440feadbd960169038f843d4ea.mp4?t=1793289474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">.....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORATION: wander a unique semi-open world. Find your own way through the Nameless City.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BRANCHED DIALOGUES, CHOICES &amp; ALTERNATIVE ENDINGS: Meet the strange inhabitants of the Far Reaches. Dreamers, spirits, creatures and bizarre figures — they are all caught in the same web of causality. Your actions influence their destinies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAYERED WORLD: Interact with your environment. Transform the materia of dreams and the City with it. Lift the veils that conceal reality. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/c80dfde41dafd39b468be3316e4677c2.poster.avif?t=1793289474\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/c80dfde41dafd39b468be3316e4677c2.webm?t=1793289474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/c80dfde41dafd39b468be3316e4677c2.mp4?t=1793289474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">.....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861210/extras/32dd738c7764cfd1cfdc27ee2ab12c4a.avif?t=1793289474\" width=1560 height=650 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5008X 8-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3060 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Redlock Studio"],"publishers":["Redlock Studio"],"release_date":"Oct 29, 2026"}